      "severity": "medium",
      "file": "src/components/ui/Screen.tsx",
      "issue": "The global offline banner defined in DESIGN.md is not rendered on any screen when the device is offline.",
      "fix": "Add a `NetworkInfo` listener (or expo‑network) in the `Screen` component and conditionally render a full‑width banner with the text \"You are offline. Some actions require an internet connection.\" using `theme.colors.surfaceVariant` and proper padding. Ensure the banner appears above the screen content on both mobile and web."
    },
    {
      "severity": "medium",
      "file": "src/components/ui/EmptyState.tsx",
      "issue": "Empty‑state description reads \"Add a receipt to start tracking your finances.\" – it omits the required reference to mileage entries.",
      "fix": "Update the description to \"Add a receipt or mileage entry to start tracking your finances.\" matching the copy in DESIGN.md."
    },
    {
      "severity": "low",
      "file": "src/components/ui/DatePickerField.tsx",
